WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:06,830
Xiao Shen

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,280
The furniture in several households downstairs was almost burned out.

3
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:11,700
No one can go out to find fuel in this weather. We discussed it.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,580
We are going to open all the empty rooms in the building that are not occupied by anyone.

5
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,220
Take out the furniture that can be burned and distribute it securely

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,300
Yes, I will join the meeting on the seventh floor at 12 noon.

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,300
Okay, my family is not short of fuel, but if everyone participates, I will be more conspicuous by doing nothing. Only then will the nuclear group be safe.

8
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,390
I went door to door in the morning and asked

9
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,110
There are only 12 households that are still occupied by people.

10
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:30,430
Two of them have enough fuel

11
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,510
Not participating in today’s property search

12
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:33,950
The remaining ten households will be divided into materials according to how much they handle.

13
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:36,310
The fifth floor has been moved and the sixth floor is moving up.

14
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:37,910
There is still time to check for unoccupied houses

15
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,310
All several vehicles have been processed today

16
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,590
Found food, fuel, supplies and daily necessities

17
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,350
Put them together on the seventh floor and share them together at the end.
